Subject: [PATCH] Remove duplicate go-first icons that invalidate GTK cache

Remove the accidental go-first copy.svg files at 22, 24 and 48 px. The correctly named go-first.svg artwork is identical and resolves independently. GTK scans these files even when symbolic action directories are inactive in the theme index.

Verified that gtk-update-icon-cache fails with the duplicates, succeeds after removal, and the generated cache passes validation.

BUG: 528955
